---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What Naturally Restful collects (spoiler: almost nothing), why, and your rights under GDPR and CCPA."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Last updated: September 2026 · Template — review before launch.</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        We collect as little as possible. Reading the site requires no account and stores nothing
        about you on our side. When monetization features are added (ads, email), they'll only
        run with your consent where the law requires it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Nothing required to browse.</strong> This is a static site — pages are served from a CDN (Cloudflare), which processes standard technical logs (IP address, requested page, timestamp) for security and performance. We don't analyze those logs to profile you.</li>
        <li><strong>Email — only if you subscribe.</strong> Address, signup time, and confirmation status. Double opt-in. Unsubscribe link in every email. Never sold, rented, or shared.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact form.</strong> If you use it, we receive what you typed and keep it only to answer you.</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate links.</strong> When you click an outbound affiliate link, the destination merchant may set cookies and process your data under <em>their</em> privacy policy.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies and consent</h2>
      <p>
        The site currently sets one functional item: a local browser preference recording your
        cookie-consent choice. It never leaves your browser. If display advertising is added,
        a Google-certified consent banner will gate advertising and analytics cookies for
        visitors from the EEA and UK, per Google's EU user consent policy and GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights (GDPR — EU/UK visitors)</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or portability of your data,
        object to processing, and withdraw consent at any time. Email
        <a href="mailto:hello@naturallyrestful.xyz">hello@naturallyrestful.xyz</a> — we respond
        within 30 days. You may also complain to your national data protection authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights (CCPA/CPRA — California visitors)</h2>
      <p>
        You may request disclosure of personal information collected, deletion, and correction,
        and you will not be discriminated against for exercising these rights. California law
        considers some sharing (e.g., advertising cookies) to be a "sale" — opt out via the
        cookie banner's Reject button or by email.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>The site is not directed at children under 13 (16 in the EEA) and we don't knowingly collect their data.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>Material changes to this policy will be reflected in the "last updated" date above.</p>

      <p>Questions or requests? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
